rt is here: <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://app.n8n.cloud/register"><u>app.n8n.cloud/register</u></a>.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re in a defining moment of an incredible journey. Come and build with us.</p><h3>🎯 Your main goal will be to build and operate n8n’s shared context infrastructure — our “company brain” — so both people and AI agents can reliably access accurate, well-structured, and appropriately governed knowledge across the company.</h3><p style="min-height:1.5em">To make that happen, you’ll shape how our knowledge is structured, contributed, accessed, and maintained as we build the context layer powering n8n’s agentic future:</p><h3>DESIGN OUR INFORMATION ARCHITECTURE</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Define the taxonomy, structure, contributor guidelines, and templates that turn fragmented company knowledge into reliable, reusable context.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Establish standards that make knowledge easy to navigate, maintain, and use without creating duplication or another layer of content sprawl.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Evolve these standards as our functions, knowledge sources, and agentic use cases grow.</p></li></ul><h3>ONBOARD &amp; ENABLE TEAMS</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Onboard functions to the company brain and train designated champions to structure and maintain their own knowledge over time.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Give non-technical contributors the guidance, templates, and support they need to contribute high-quality context independently.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with the Internal AI Enablement Lead to develop a shared network of champions who help scale strong knowledge practices across n8n.</p></li></ul><h3>OPERATE OUR CONTEXT PLATFORM</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Configure and operate ingestion from qualitative sources such as Slack, Gong, Drive, and Notion using our context platform’s tooling.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own day-to-day platform configuration and basic troubleshooting, escalating genuine engineering challenges to our Automation team or vendor when needed.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with IT, Security, and Legal to define requirements for how people and AI agents access sensitive company knowledge.</p></li></ul><h3>BUILD FOR LONG-TERM TRUST &amp; REUSE</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Keep content structures, contributor guidelines, and knowledge freshness current as n8n and the platform evolve.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work with functions to ensure the company brain becomes a trusted source of context rather than another parallel knowledge repository.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Provide product feedback to our context platform vendor and anticipate shared context patterns and capabilities that future agents will need.</p></li></ul><h2>REQUIREMENTS</h2><h3><strong>Must-haves</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🗂️ Information architecture:</strong> You have proven experience designing structured content or knowledge programs at scale, including taxonomies, style guides, contributor guidelines, templates, or information architecture.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🧠 Knowledge systems experience:</strong> You’ve worked hands-on with knowledge or context systems and understand what it takes to turn fragmented qualitative information into something others can reliably use.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>⚙️ SaaS platform fluency:</strong> You’re comfortable configuring and operating SaaS knowledge or context platforms, working with APIs and integrations, and independently troubleshooting basic issues.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🎓 Stakeholder enablement:</strong> You have a track record of training non-technical stakeholders and enabling them to confidently maintain high-quality content themselves over the long term.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🔐 Governance collaboration:</strong> You’re comfortable partnering with IT, Security, and Legal on access requirements and compliance-sensitive data flows without needing to own the underlying technical architecture.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>✍️ Communication:</strong> You have strong written and verbal communication skills and can set a clear quality bar for how company knowledge is structured, documented, and shared.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Nice-to-haves</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🤖 Context platforms:</strong> You’re familiar with <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://Qontext.ai">Qontext.ai</a> or a comparable agent-context platform.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🔌 MCP:</strong> You have experience with or a strong understanding of Model Context Protocol (MCP).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🏷️ Knowledge governance:</strong> You have a background in knowledge management, metadata, or data governance.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Why join us?</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At n8n, you’ll have the opportunity to shape how an entire company’s knowledge becomes usable — not only by people, but by the AI agents increasingly working alongside them. You’ll build a capability we don’t have today and help establish the context layer that future agentic initiatives across n8n will depend on.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll have real ownership over how company knowledge is structured, governed, and maintained, while working closely with teams across IT, Security, Legal, Data, and AI &amp; Automation. You’ll also have the support of a strong technical team and vendor partner, so your focus can stay on creating a trusted, scalable knowledge system rather than building every piece of infrastructure from scratch.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">As n8n grows, you’ll help turn fragmented knowledge into a shared company brain that teams can contribute to confidently and agents can depend on reliably.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Sound like a challenge you’re excited to take on?</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Apply now — and help us build the context layer for the future of automation.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>n8n is an equal opportunity employer and does not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>We can sponsor visas to Germany; for any other country, you need to have existing right to work.</em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em><strong>Our company language is English.</strong></em></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>You care about diversity and inclusion? We do too! Check out our </em><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.notion.so/Diversity-inclusion-and-belonging-n8n-c1bec2fff536422d868b1a438d990e35?pvs=21"><em>Diversity, Inclusion and Belonging initiatives at n8n</em></a><em> (</em><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.notion.so/n8n/Diversity-inclusion-and-belonging-n8n-c1bec2fff536422d868b1a438d990e35"><em>https://www.notion.so/n8n/Diversity-inclusion-and-belonging-n8n-c1bec2fff536422d868b1a438d990e35</em></a><em>).</em></p><h2></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em><strong>Location disclaimer:</strong> If you see multiple job postings for the same role, it is most likely because we're hiring remotely for this role and posting in different locations to make sure every potential candidate can see the role. Please apply to the location you're the most likely to work from in the future. </em></p><p styl