rowth scale-up.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h3><strong>Nice-to-haves</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🌍 International &amp; remote experience:</strong> You’ve supported distributed teams across EU/UK/US.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🏛️ Works council familiarity:</strong> You understand regional nuances and WC engagement.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🧮 People analytics savvy:</strong> You’re comfortable interpreting metrics and turning them into decisions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>⚙️ High-growth SaaS background:</strong> You’ve partnered in product-led or hypergrowth tech environments.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>📘 Manager enablement design:</strong> You’ve built/delivered trainings, toolkits, or playbooks at scale.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🧱 Succession exposure:</strong> You’ve supported successor identification and development planning.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🧑‍💻 Tech business partnering background:</strong> You’ve partnered closely with Engineering/Product teams.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Why join us?</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At n8n, your work won’t disappear into a slide deck. You’ll be the force multiplier behind how we scale from ~400 to ~1000+ people: raising manager capability, sharpening performance, and keeping our builder culture strong as we grow. You’ll partner directly with executives, shape org design and calibration at the company’s most pivotal stage, and build pragmatic, lightweight processes that help teams ship faster. You’ll join a supportive, remote-first team across EU/UK/US that values autonomy, candor, and experimentation.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Sound like a challenge you’re excited to take on?</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Apply now — and help us build the future of autom