&lt;p&gt;AI coding is the largest use case of enterprise AI adoption today, as is evident from the success of Anthropic on Claude Code, Cursor’s $60B exit to SpaceX, and Cognition’s $48B valuation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The bottleneck now has moved from code generation to security and safety - AI agents write code faster than any team can review it, and over 65% of the lines of code produced by them are insecure. Vulnerabilities are piling up 16x faster than companies can fix them, and adversaries are able to exploit these new vulnerabilities within hours.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;AURI by Endor Labs closes that gap. It runs inside the harness where coding agents work, through hooks, skills and MCP, so the controls sit outside the model and every agent action is visible. Underneath is our patented code context graph, which maps code, open source, containers and infrastructure. It shows which vulnerabilities can actually be reached and exploited, then delivers fixes that won’t break the application. Security teams get evidence instead of noise, and developers get fixes instead of tickets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The companies building AI trust us to secure it - our customers include OpenAI, SpaceX, DoorDash, Dropbox, Atlassian, MongoDB, Snowflake, Robinhood and Peloton to name a few.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Endor Labs is the third company from Founder &amp;amp; CEO Varun Badhwar, who built Prisma Cloud, the platform that helped define cloud security, from $0 to $300M ARR at Palo Alto Networks. We’ve raised $163M from Lightspeed, Coatue, DFJ Growth, Salesforce Ventures and Dell Technologies Capital.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Software runs everything around our lives today - banking, hospitals, airports and power grids. AI now writes more of it every day, and our mission is to make sure the world can trust that software. Come build that future with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;How-You’ll-Make-an-Impact&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;876&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;How You’ll Make an Impact&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Solutions Architect at Endor Labs, you&#39;re at the heart of connecting our innovative team with our diverse and dynamic customers. Every day presents a new set of exciting challenges and opportunities to make a significant impact:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Educate with Enthusiasm:&lt;/strong&gt; Elevate awareness about Application Security and Software Supply Chain Security. It&#39;s about making security engaging and accessible to developers everywhere.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master Our Tech:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep dive into our supply chain security product suite and emerge as the go-to expert and evangelist.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver Tailored Demos:&lt;/strong&gt; Showcase our solutions in a way that speaks directly to the needs and challenges of our customers. Be the architect of captivating, solution-oriented presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape Customer Outcomes:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with our engineering and product teams to design solutions that genuinely address customer challenges. Your insights from the field will directly influence our product development, ensuring we always meet our customers&#39; evolving needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Facilitate Customer Success:&lt;/strong&gt; Guide customers through onboarding, ensuring a smooth transition and adoption of the Endor Labs solution. Your goal is to empower customers to leverage our technology fully and ensure they achieve their security and development objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring to the Table&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re on the hunt for someone who is not just looking for a job but likes a bit of adventure, too! You&#39;ll fit right in if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;poqw43&quot; data-start=&quot;297&quot; data-end=&quot;491&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;299&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Rich Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; You have experience in pre-sales or a similar customer-facing, technical role. You&#39;re no stranger to technical deep dives, product demonstrations, and leading evaluations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hrgdhb&quot; data-start=&quot;493&quot; data-end=&quot;841&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;495&quot; data-end=&quot;527&quot;&gt;Strong Technical Foundation:&lt;/strong&gt; A solid understanding of modern software development practices, including backend or full-stack development experience, CI/CD pipelines, Git-based development workflows, and DevOps tooling. You’re comfortable engaging deeply with engineering teams and understanding how modern applications are built and deployed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;44alsd&quot; data-start=&quot;843&quot; data-end=&quot;1108&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;845&quot; data-end=&quot;880&quot;&gt;Application Security Awareness:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with application security concepts, software supply chain security, and/or identity &amp;amp; access management principles. You understand the importance of securing developer workflows and modern cloud-native environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;xiq5d5&quot; data-start=&quot;1110&quot; data-end=&quot;1310&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1112&quot; data-end=&quot;1127&quot;&gt;Tech Savvy:&lt;/strong&gt; A robust understanding of the Developer, DevOps, Application Security, and open-source ecosystems. Hopefully, you can meet developers where they are and flex some programming skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;otuo74&quot; data-start=&quot;1312&quot; data-end=&quot;1493&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1314&quot; data-end=&quot;1342&quot;&gt;Customer &amp;amp; Sales Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve successfully engaged with technical customers at an Enterprise level and know how to articulate complex solutions and operate in a sales cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;roopa0&quot; data-start=&quot;1495&quot; data-end=&quot;1625&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1497&quot; data-end=&quot;1528&quot;&gt;Curious and Eager to Learn:&lt;/strong&gt; Always on the lookout for new technologies and understanding the intricacies of how things work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12ecp9k&quot; data-start=&quot;1627&quot; data-end=&quot;1739&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1629&quot; data-end=&quot;1654&quot;&gt;Collaborative Spirit:&lt;/strong&gt; You thrive in a team setting and value diversity and inclusion in every interaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;25v10y&quot; data-start=&quot;1741&quot; data-end=&quot;1840&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1743&quot; data-end=&quot;1763&quot;&gt;Action-oriented:&lt;/strong&gt; You prefer actively solving customer problems and asking for help as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes Us... Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Go to extraordinary lengths to distinguish ourselves through world-class work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritize quality over speed, and speed over scope.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desire to work with deeply kind, mission-driven people.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strive to make the complex simple.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use first principles to debate ideas, test assumptions, and make decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Seek the truth by putting data above opinions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assume good intent and give tactical feedback to help each other get better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold no ego—when our customers win, we all win.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and comprehensive benefits package including Health, Dental, Vision and Mental Health plans.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) plan to support your longterm financial goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible PTO to maintain a healthy work-life balance (we want you here for the long-haul!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities for co-working and team meetups to foster collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office environment for those who love to bring their fur babies along.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Endor Labs is an Equal Opportunity Employer.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees. Even if you don&#39;t fit every requirement above, we believe in the power of diverse perspectives and experiences, so we encourage all talented individuals to apply—there&#39;s no one-size-fits-all here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4857&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Compensation: &lt;/strong&gt;For candidates who receive an offer for this position, the compensation range is expected to be between $190,000 - $250,000. This may include additional incentives such as commission targets, restricted stock units, and/or bonuses, depending on the role.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/endorlabs/solutions-architect-emea-466435","tags":["Customer Solutions"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1792011350},{"slug":"senior-talent-attraction-specialist-parsdorf-bavaria-171419","company_name":"isaraerospace","title":"Senior Talent Attraction Specialist (m/f/d)","description":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission Brief&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we scale to reach orbit, we are looking for a Senior Talent Attraction Specialist to build and own some of the most high-leverage, relationship-driven parts of our recruiting function.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone who thrives in fast-paced, high-growth environments and loves the hunt — bringing proven recruiting expertise to shape how we hire and grow. You will work closely with hiring managers and our leadership team on complex, high-impact roles, coach other recruiters on the team, and take ownership of some of our most business-critical hiring processes from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your Role in Our Space Mission:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted recruiting advisor to hiring managers and our leadership team, anticipating hiring needs and independently choosing the right approach for complex or cross-functional roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring market insights and recruiting expertise to the table to influence hiring decisions, and build long-term stakeholder relationships across the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and drive sourcing strategies for hard-to-fill or high-impact roles, building and continuously improving talent pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a first point of contact and senior brand ambassador for Isar Aerospace, representing the company confidently in complex or high-stakes candidate conversations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own multiple concurrent and complex recruitment processes, anticipating bottlenecks and adjusting priorities independently to deliver results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train and coach interviewers on structured hiring techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own recruiting KPIs for your area, using data to identify process improvements and share insights with the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualification Checklist&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in business, psychology, HR, or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of full-cycle recruiting experience, including experience in a fast-paced, high-growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of independently managing complex or cross-functional hiring processes and influencing hiring decisions at the stakeholder level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing sourcing strategies and coaching or mentoring others&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident working with different recruiting tools, experience with Greenhouse as ATS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, negotiation, and stakeholder management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding organization and attention to detail, even across multiple concurrent processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English and German&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in Swedish, Norwegian or French is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Participation Program: &lt;/strong&gt;Share in our success through our virtual company share program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;30 days of vacation: &lt;/strong&gt;Enjoy the days off to relax and recharge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company pension plan:&lt;/strong&gt; Secure your future with our company pension plan, featuring a 20% employer contribution after the probation period&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subsidised lunch:&lt;/strong&gt; Stay energised with delicious, subsidised lunches every day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sport Clubs membership: &lt;/strong&gt;Stay fit with our sponsored sports club memberships (EGYM Wellpass)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning allowance:&lt;/strong&gt; Grow your skills with an individual learning budget granted after the probation period&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Childcare allowance:&lt;/strong&gt; Receive a childcare allowance for your non-school-age children&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible mobility budget&lt;/strong&gt;: Travel your way with a choice between a fully financed Deutschlandticket, JobRad bicycle leasing, FINN JobAuto, or a fuel allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And Much More!&lt;/strong&gt; Discover additional perks and benefits when you join our team&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Who we are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/jW2V5vsMb_k&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;We are Isar Aerospace and we are at the forefront of New Space building a modern space business to enable faster, better and cheaper access to space.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Our mission is to help democratise space and use it for good in order to improve life on Earth now and for the future generations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;We are a fast-growing company aiming to provide sustainable and environmentally friendly launch solutions for small and medium-sized satellites and constellations into Low Earth Orbit. The company is privately funded by world-leading technology investors with strong commitment and support and our team is made of driven and talented people with a real passion for space innovation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;We&#39;re making rockets in a way that hasn&#39;t been done before disrupting a traditional industry. If you are up for the challenge, want to work on cutting-edge projects and be part of a team changing the world for better, come, join us and launch your career!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Want to find out more about us?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot;&gt;Visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;DE&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.isaraerospace.com/&quot;&gt;www.isaraerospace.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Protection&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We process your personal data for the purpose of managing the recruitment process and assessing your application. For detailed information on how your data is processed, including your rights, please refer to our &lt;a id=&quot;menur2mlt&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://isaraerospace.com/privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
