&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CV, including publications, code, or research projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cover letter (1–2 pages) explaining your motivation, research interests, and fit with the project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A link to code you have written.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A one-page research statement picking one open research question from the project and sketching how you would approach it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s and Bachelor’s degree certificate and transcripts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contact information for 2–3 academic referees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
