&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/bloomreach/senior-business-development-representative-benelux-115744","tags":["Revenue"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1792011346},{"slug":"principal-solutions-architect-237669","company_name":"Bloomreach","title":"Principal Solutions Architect","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Bloomreach is building the world’s premier&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;agentic platform for personalization&lt;/strong&gt;.We’re revolutionizing how businesses connect with their customers, building and deploying AI agents to personalize the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;entire&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;customer journey.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We&#39;re taking&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;autonomous search&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;mainstream, making product discovery more intuitive and conversational for customers, and more profitable for businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We’re making&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;conversational shopping&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;a reality, connecting every shopper with tailored guidance and product expertise — available on demand, at every touchpoint in their journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We&#39;re designing the future of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;autonomous marketing&lt;/strong&gt;, taking the work out of workflows, and reclaiming the creative, strategic, and customer-first work marketers were always meant to do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;And we&#39;re building all of that on the intelligence of a single AI engine —&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Loomi &lt;/strong&gt;— so that personalization isn&#39;t only autonomous…it&#39;s also consistent.From retail to financial services, hospitality to gaming, businesses use Bloomreach to drive higher growth and lasting loyalty. We power personalization for more than 1,400 global brands, including American Eagle, Sonepar, and Pandora.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Principal Solutions Architect&lt;/strong&gt; is a Senior, Global, customer-facing technology role responsible for helping Bloomreach win and grow strategic enterprise customers by connecting their business objectives with modern data, AI, MarTech and commerce architectures.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will act as a trusted technical advisor to senior technology and digital leaders, helping customers understand how Bloomreach can fit into - and enhance - their existing technology ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with our Global Account Executives, Solution Consultants, Product, Engineering and Customer Success Teams, you will shape technical strategy throughout complex enterprise sales cycles, lead executive and technical conversations, and help potential customers translate architectural decisions into measurable business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits between &lt;strong&gt;deep technical architecture and commercial strategy&lt;/strong&gt;. You do not need to have been a CTO, but you should be comfortable engaging with CIOs, CTOs, Enterprise Architects and other senior technology stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Technology &amp;amp; Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior technical advisor for global strategic enterprise opportunities and customer engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with CIOs, CTOs, Enterprise Architects, Chief Digital Officers and senior technology teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand and map complex customer technology environments, identifying where Bloomreach can create value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Whiteboard and communicate complex architectures, data flows and integration strategies with technical and executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise customers on how data moves from systems of record through to real-time decisioning, personalization and activation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help customers evaluate architectural trade-offs across data platforms, APIs, cloud infrastructure, identity, governance, latency and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explain where traditional warehouse-centric approaches may not fully support real-time customer decisioning and activation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data, AI &amp;amp; MarTech&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring strong expertise across modern data architectures, including Databricks, Snowflake, lakehouses, CDPs, APIs and cloud platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand identity resolution, event streams, customer profiles, data governance and real-time data requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand enterprise MarTech ecosystems including ESPs, personalization, CRM, commerce and marketing automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help customers understand how Bloomreach fits within their broader data, AI, commerce and MarTech ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current on emerging technologies and architectural patterns across AI, data, commerce and digital experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Sales &amp;amp; Commercial Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our Global Account Executives and Solution Consultants&amp;nbsp; throughout complex enterprise sales cycles to shape technical strategy and increase deal confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support RFPs, technical validation, executive presentations, architecture reviews and customer workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect technical and architectural decisions to business outcomes, including revenue, cost, risk and time-to-value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help identify and remove technical barriers that could prevent enterprise opportunities from progressing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring strong commercial instincts and an understanding of how technology decisions influence enterprise buying processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge customer assumptions where appropriate while maintaining a consultative, outcome-focused approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internal &amp;amp; Market Influence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our Global Product and Engineering teams to bring customer insights, market trends and architectural requirements back into Bloomreach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Constructively challenge internal teams when customer needs or market opportunities require a different approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor Solution Consultants and other customer-facing teams on modern data architecture, AI, enterprise technology and industry trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop relationships with strategic technology partners including hyperscalers, commerce platforms, CDPs and systems integrators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to customer technology briefings, industry events and thought leadership where relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience in a senior customer-facing technical role within enterprise software, SaaS, commerce, MarTech, data or digital experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of modern data architecture and cloud platforms, including technologies such as &lt;strong&gt;Databricks, Snowflake, BigQuery, lakehouses and CDPs&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of APIs, event-driven architectures, data flows, identity resolution, customer profiles and real-time activation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of enterprise MarTech and commerce ecosystems, including CRM, ESPs, personalization, marketing automation and commerce platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with enterprise cloud platforms such as AWS, Google Cloud or Microsoft Azure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of modern commerce architectures, APIs, microservices, composable commerce and cloud-native technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting complex enterprise sales cycles, RFPs, technical evaluations and multi-stakeholder buying processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with senior technical stakeholders including CIOs, CTOs, Enterprise Architects and technology leadership teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to simplify complex technical concepts and connect them to business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive communication, presentation and workshop facilitation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially minded, with the ability to understand the relationship between architecture, investment, risk and business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable challenging customers and internal Product/Engineering teams constructively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong curiosity and ability to learn and communicate emerging technologies, particularly across AI, data and customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence and credibility without needing to have previously held a CTO or equivalent executive technology position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Success in the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First 30 Days&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with our Global Sales, Channel, Solution Engineering, Product, Engineering and Customer Success teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a strong understanding of Bloomreach&#39;s platform, AI capabilities, architecture, competitive positioning and strategic enterprise accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build familiarity with the broader data, MarTech and commerce ecosystem in which Bloomreach operates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First 60 Days&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Begin actively supporting strategic enterprise opportunities, participating in customer meetings, architecture discussions, technical workshops and solution reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish credibility with Sales and technical stakeholders as a trusted technology partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start identifying common customer architecture challenges and opportunities where Bloomreach can differentiate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First 90 Days&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical strategy and architecture discussions across multiple strategic enterprise opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish trusted relationships with senior customer technology stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate the ability to connect customer architecture and technology strategy to Bloomreach&#39;s commercial value proposition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become a recognised internal technology advisor for strategic enterprise sales, bringing customer insight and market knowledge into Sales, Product and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to accelerating complex opportunities, improving technical confidence and strengthening Bloomreach&#39;s position within enterprise technology ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;More things you&#39;ll like about Bloomreach:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A great deal of freedom and trust. At Bloomreach we don’t clock in and out, and we have neither corporate rules nor long approval processes. This freedom goes hand in hand with responsibility. We are interested in results from day one.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We have defined our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bloomreach.com/en/careers?utm_source=Job-Description-Footer&amp;amp;utm_medium=Job-Description&amp;amp;utm_content=Hyperlink-1&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;5 values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; and the 10 underlying key behaviors that we strongly believe in. We can only succeed if everyone lives these behaviors day to day. We&#39;ve embedded them in our processes like recruitment, onboarding, feedback, personal development, performance review and internal communication.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We believe in flexible working hours to accommodate your working style.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We work virtual-first with several Bloomreach Hubs available across three continents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We organize company events to experience the global spirit of the company and get excited about what&#39;s ahead.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We encourage and support our employees to engage in volunteering activities - every Bloomreacher can take 5 paid days off to volunteer*.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.glassdoor.com/Overview/Working-at-Bloomreach-EI_IE442167.11,21.htm&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Bloomreach Glassdoor page&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; elaborates on our stellar 4.7/5 rating. The &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.comparably.com/companies/bloomreach&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Bloomreach Comparably page&lt;/a&gt; Culture score is even higher at 4.9/5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We have a People Development Program - participating in personal development workshops on various topics run by experts from inside the company. We are continuously developing &amp;amp; updating competency maps for select functions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our resident communication coach &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/ivo-ve%C4%8De%C5%99a-2a94291/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ivo Večeřa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; is available to help navigate work-related communications &amp;amp; decision-making challenges.*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our managers are strongly encouraged to participate in the Leader Development Program to develop in the areas we consider essential for any leader. The program includes regular comprehensive feedback, consultations with a coach and follow-up check-ins.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Bloomreachers utilize the $1,500 professional education budget on an annual basis to purchase education products (books, courses, certifications, etc.)*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Well-being:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The Employee Assistance Program -- with counselors -- is available for non-work-related challenges.*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Subscription to Calm - sleep and meditation app.*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We organize ‘DisConnect’ days where Bloomreachers globally enjoy one additional day off each quarter, allowing us to unwind together and focus on activities away from the screen with our loved ones.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We facilitate sports, yoga, and meditation opportunities for each other.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Extended parental leave up to 26 calendar weeks for Primary Caregivers.*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Restricted Stock Units or Stock Options are granted depending on a team member’s role, seniority, and location.*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Everyone gets to participate in the company&#39;s success through the company performance bonus.*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We offer an employee referral bonus of up to $3,000!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We reward &amp;amp; celebrate work anniversaries -- Bloomversaries!*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;(*Subject to employment type. Interns are exempt from marked benefits, usually for the first 6 months.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excited? Join us and transform the future of commerce experiences!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;If this position doesn&#39;t suit you, but you know someone who might be a great fit, share it - we will be very grateful!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Any unsolicited resumes/candidate profiles submitted through our website or to personal email accounts of employees of Bloomreach are considered property of Bloomreach and are not subject to payment of agency fees.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/bloomreach/principal-solutions-architect-237669","tags":["Revenue"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1792011346},{"slug":"senior-associate-london-31588","company_name":"Systemiq","title":"Senior Associate","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Description:&lt;/strong&gt; Systemiq is a system-change company committed to achieving the Sustainable Development Goals and the Paris Agreement by transforming markets and business models across five key systems: nature and food, materials and circularity, energy, urban areas, and sustainable finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a certified B Corp, we combine strategic advisory with high-impact, on-the-ground work, partnering with business, finance, policymakers and civil society to deliver system change. With offices across Africa, Asia, Europe and the Americas, we are dedicated exclusively to sustainability-focused work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Associate – Sustainable Finance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;London or Kenya&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract:&lt;/strong&gt; 12-month FTC&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team / Platform:&lt;/strong&gt; Sustainable Finance&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to:&lt;/strong&gt; Sustainable Finance leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;SYSTEMIQ is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Associate&lt;/strong&gt; to join our growing Sustainable Finance practice, focused on public and development finance. You will work with governments and public finance institutions to strengthen financing strategies and mobilise capital for climate, nature and development priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;This is a strategy advisory role, working in small, collaborative teams on complex advisory engagements and multi-stakeholder initiatives spanning governments, IFIs/DFIs, bilateral donors and the private sector. As a Senior Associate, you will play a key role in shaping and leading workstreams, developing client-ready analysis and materials, managing stakeholder relationships, and contributing to the growth of SYSTEMIQ’s sustainable finance work in Kenya and the wider region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;This role blends macro-level strategic thinking with strong research and analytical skills, excellent stakeholder engagement and communication, and the ability to deliver high-quality outputs in fast-moving, stakeholder-heavy contexts. Strategy consulting experience is welcome but not essential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and support workstreams delivering high-quality advisory support on public and development finance for climate and nature outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop structured analysis and synthesise complex information into client-ready outputs, including strategy decks, technical notes, briefing packs and recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive work on sovereign financing strategies, including consideration of macroeconomic context, sovereign risk, debt sustainability and credit dynamics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help design, shape and assess financing approaches and instruments, including concessional and blended finance, sustainability-linked bonds/loans, debt-for-climate/nature swaps, and risk-sharing structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and support stakeholder engagement across ministries, debt management offices, central banks, IFIs/DFIs, donors and private sector partners, including workshops and convenings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide strategic insight and practical recommendations to support successful financing strategies and implementation pathways.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to proposal development, thought leadership and knowledge building within the Sustainable Finance team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and mentor more junior team members, contributing to a collaborative, inclusive and high-performing team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Mindset, skills &amp;amp; experience&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We are seeking candidates who can demonstrate a strong commitment to SYSTEMIQ’s mission and a passion for systems change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Essential&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s degree or equivalent experience in economics, finance, international development, public policy or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Typically 4+ years of relevant experience, for example in:
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;strategy consulting, ideally with exposure to sustainable finance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;international financial institutions such as the IMF, World Bank or AfDB;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;central banks, debt management offices, finance ministries or public finance institutions;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;credit rating agencies;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;sovereign research or strategy teams;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;development finance or advisory roles with strong sovereign finance exposure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong familiarity with the sovereign financing landscape, including concessional finance, blended finance and/or climate and nature finance instruments such as sustainability-linked bonds/loans and debt-for-climate/nature swaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of macroeconomic context, sovereign risk, debt sustainability and credit dynamics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving, analytical and research skills, with the ability to synthesise complex material into clear, structured and actionable outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and influencing skills, including excellent written and verbal English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated stakeholder engagement skills, ideally in government-facing or multi-stakeholder environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project discipline and ability to deliver high-quality work under tight deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial, proactive and adaptable mindset, with the ability to navigate ambiguity and drive work forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative team player with strong mission alignment and willingness to support others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Desirable&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formal study in economics, with a focus on macroeconomics, development economics, climate economics and/or nature economics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to public-sector policy or planning, for example within finance ministries, environment ministries, or IFIs/DFIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting stakeholder consultations, convenings or government-facing processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Candidate profile&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You are mission-driven and excited by the opportunity to help governments and financial institutions mobilise financing for climate and nature outcomes. You combine intellectual rigour with pragmatism and strong relationship skills. You are comfortable leading workstreams, structuring complex problems, engaging senior stakeholders and supporting junior colleagues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You thrive in small teams, enjoy working across disciplines and stakeholder groups, and want your work to influence real-world decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You will also align naturally with our values: &lt;strong&gt;Creativity, Challenge, Collaborate, Change and Care.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;At SYSTEMIQ, we believe that diversity and inclusion are crucial to system change and our mission. We are committed to embedding diverse and inclusive practices in all aspects of our work, including recruitment, performance management, people processes and policies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We aim to provide a supportive environment where everyone can be themselves and perform at their best, regardless of background, personality, gender, sexual orientation, race, mental health, religion or other characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Additional information&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Only applications from candidates legally eligible to work in Kenya or UK will be considered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Visa sponsorship and relocation costs will not be provided.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The remuneration and benefits package will reflect the successful candidate’s experience and expertise.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;description__body&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;578&quot; data-end=&quot;603&quot;&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;603&quot; data-end=&quot;606&quot;&gt;At Systemiq, we absolutely believe diverse perspectives are essential to driving system change. We are committed to creating an inclusive workplace where people feel respected, supported and able to do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Click&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.systemiq.earth/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to view our Data Policy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/systemiq/senior-associate-london-31588","tags":["Sustainable Finance"],"job_types":[],"location":"London","created_at":1792011344},{"slug":"it-support-contractor-london-388947","company_name":"Systemiq","title":"IT Support Contractor","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Description:&lt;/strong&gt; Systemiq is a system-change company committed to achieving the Sustainable Development Goals and the Paris Agreement by transforming markets and business models across five key systems: nature and food, materials and circularity, energy, urban areas, and sustainable finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a certified B Corp, we combine strategic advisory with high-impact, on-the-ground work, partnering with business, finance, policymakers and civil society to deliver system change. With offices across Africa, Asia, Europe and the Americas, we are dedicated exclusively to sustainability-focused work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Title: IT Support Contractor &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to:&lt;/strong&gt; IT Operations Manager&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London office (hybrid. 3 days in office)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract type:&lt;/strong&gt; day rate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purpose of the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Systemiq is looking for a Level 1 IT Support Contractor to provide first-line technical support to staff. The role covers day-to-day IT support tasks currently handled by the team, including hardware setup, ticket triage, and office technology support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to and resolve first-line IT support tickets, escalating complex issues to Level 2 or 3 as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up and configure laptops, monitors, and other hardware for new starters and existing staff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support office print infrastructure, including troubleshooting printers and managing print queues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage user account requests, such as password resets and access changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate records of support requests and resolutions in the ticketing system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support onboarding and offboarding processes, including account creation and equipment provisioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide basic support for common software tools and internal systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and maintain office wifi, including troubleshooting connectivity issues and liaising with the network provider where needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep IT policy documents up to date and aligned with the International Organization for Standardization&#39;s ISO 27001 information security standard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide remote support to staff in other Systemiq offices, resolving issues where possible and escalating on-site work to local contacts as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate recurring or systemic issues to the IT Operations Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and experience required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in a first-line IT support or helpdesk role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Windows 11&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Microsoft Office 365 and Microsoft Entra ID (formerly Azure AD), including user and access management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with common office hardware (printers, monitors, laptops) and basic network troubleshooting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awareness of information security standards, ideally ISO 27001&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and a customer-focused approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to prioritise and manage multiple requests at once&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ticketing systems (e.g. ServiceNow, solarwinds) is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;description__body&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
