&lt;p&gt;Click&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.systemiq.earth/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to view our Data Policy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/systemiq/it-support-contractor-london-388947","tags":["Information Technology"],"job_types":[],"location":"London","created_at":1792011344},{"slug":"director-power-systems-and-grid-transformation-london-421365","company_name":"Systemiq","title":"Director -Power Systems and Grid transformation","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Description:&lt;/strong&gt; Systemiq is a system-change company committed to achieving the Sustainable Development Goals and the Paris Agreement by transforming markets and business models across five key systems: nature and food, materials and circularity, energy, urban areas, and sustainable finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a certified B Corp, we combine strategic advisory with high-impact, on-the-ground work, partnering with business, finance, policymakers and civil society to deliver system change. With offices across Africa, Asia, Europe and the Americas, we are dedicated exclusively to sustainability-focused work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Director, Power Systems &amp;amp; Grid Transformation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Amsterdam ( preferred), or London &lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to:&lt;/strong&gt; Eveline Speelman, Global Energy Platform Lead&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role type:&lt;/strong&gt; Full-time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Systemiq is seeking a Director with deep expertise in power system transformation, with a particular focus on grids, system planning, flexibility, market design, utility transformation, and the integration of renewables at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will help clients address some of the most critical bottlenecks in the energy transition: grid constraints, connection queues, system adequacy, flexibility markets, transmission and distribution investment, regulatory reform, and the changing role of utilities and system operators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a generalist energy transition role. We are looking for a senior strategy leader who understands how power systems actually work technically, commercially, and institutionally, and who can help clients unlock the grid, market, and system integration challenges now slowing the transition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior leadership role combining:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep power systems expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Top-tier strategy problem solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Origination and senior client leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivery of complex, multi-stakeholder programmes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team leadership and platform-building&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with Eveline Speelman and global partners to build Systemiq’s work on power system transformation, with a particular focus on grids, flexibility, market design, utilities, and system-level decarbonisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Power Systems &amp;amp; Grid Transformation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead work on power system transformation, including grid constraints, transmission and distribution investment, system planning, flexibility, renewables integration, and utility transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise clients on the strategic, regulatory, commercial, and institutional choices needed to accelerate power system decarbonisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate technical power system challenges into clear strategic recommendations for senior decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify the practical barriers slowing power system transformation and shape interventions to overcome them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead high-impact strategy engagements with corporates, governments, investors, utilities, system operators, and other energy system actors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structure and solve complex, ambiguous problems and translate them into actionable recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise senior stakeholders, including C-suite leaders and policymakers, on transition pathways, investment priorities, and market-shaping decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems Change &amp;amp; Platform Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape and drive system-level interventions beyond individual projects, including coalitions, market-shaping initiatives, and public-private collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify structural bottlenecks across policy, infrastructure, regulation, market design, and capital allocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across sectors and stakeholders to unlock system-wide impact beyond project-level outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to Systemiq’s broader Energy platform strategy and thought leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Origination &amp;amp; Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, shape, and win new work across power systems, grids, utilities, flexibility, and energy transition topics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with senior clients, partners, and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to scaling Systemiq’s Energy platform globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and mentor high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and develop team members, building capability in power systems, analytical problem solving, and systems-level thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a collaborative, entrepreneurial, and mission-driven culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a high-calibre, strategy-led leader with deep power systems expertise and the ability to operate at the intersection of strategy, policy, regulation, infrastructure, and real-economy delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience in power systems, ideally including transmission and distribution grids, system operation, power market design, flexibility, renewables integration, storage, demand response, or utility strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Around 10 to 15+ years’ experience in strategy consulting or energy advisory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with or advising utilities, TSOs, DSOs, regulators, energy ministries, market operators, developers, infrastructure investors, or major energy users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of how grid constraints, interconnection, flexibility, storage, demand response, market reform, and regulation affect decarbonisation pathways.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate technical power system issues into strategic choices for senior decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record leading strategy engagements, complex programmes, and senior client relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to engage and influence senior stakeholders, including C-suite leaders, policymakers, regulators, and investors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience combining advisory work with real-world implementation is strongly valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Capabilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional problem structuring and analytical rigour.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial judgement and experience in origination and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to move between high-level strategy and practical implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management and influencing skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systems thinker focused on practical, scalable, real-world outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead complex work across multiple stakeholders, sectors, and geographies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in international energy systems, infrastructure investment, large-scale transition programmes, or power market reform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with digital, AI, or advanced analytical tools that improve insight generation, modelling, or delivery efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building new areas of work, propositions, or client relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial and opportunity-driven.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity and building new areas of work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative, low ego, and mission-driven.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pragmatic, intellectually rigorous, and focused on real-world impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role Matters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Power systems are now one of the central constraints in the energy transition. Renewables, electrification, storage, flexibility, industrial decarbonisation, and clean technology deployment all depend on power systems evolving faster than they are today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the centre of that challenge. It will help clients and partners address the grid, market, regulatory, and institutional barriers that determine whether economy-wide decarbonisation can happen at the pace required.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;description__body&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;578&quot; data-end=&quot;603&quot;&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;603&quot; data-end=&quot;606&quot;&gt;At Systemiq, we absolutely believe diverse perspectives are essential to driving system change. We are committed to creating an inclusive workplace where people feel respected, supported and able to do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Click&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.systemiq.earth/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; to view our Data Policy.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/systemiq/director-power-systems-and-grid-transformation-london-421365","tags":["Low-Carbon Energy"],"job_types":[],"location":"London","created_at":1792011344},{"slug":"programme-lead-enterprise-data-81599","company_name":"Wpp","title":"Programme Lead - Enterprise Data","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We work with the world&#39;s most valuable brands and have global reach across 100+ markets, with deep local expertise.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our people are the key to our success. We&#39;re committed to fostering a culture of creativity, belonging and continuous learning, attracting and developing the brightest talent, and providing exciting career opportunities that help our people grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://eur02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwpp.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CErica.Durr%40wpp.com%7C9bf4566a65bc46a48ac008de749116ea%7C150b5e663d884dee83f6ed149b727a00%7C0%7C0%7C639076363668176216%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=Q9juosud56XGLThSFZ1NpPZd6FXpJPxV74OeRZWoh%2B4%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;WPP.com.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why we&#39;re hiring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Global Programme Manager, Enterprise Data will support the Enterprise Data Programme Director in leading and delivering WPP’s global Enterprise Data programme. The role will be responsible for managing the day-to-day delivery of key programme workstreams, ensuring plans, resources, risks, dependencies and outcomes are actively managed across markets, technology teams, business stakeholders and delivery partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on programme leadership role, providing delivery momentum, structure and coordination across a complex enterprise transformation. The postholder will work closely with workstream leads, PMO, Finance, technology teams and vendors to ensure delivery is controlled, decisions are progressed, risks are managed and programme outcomes remain aligned to the Data strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role will play a key part in delivering WPP’s enterprise data transformation, supporting modernised data platforms, improved integration and standardisation, stronger data governance, trusted analytics and AI-ready data foundations across the group.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage delivery of key Enterprise Data programme workstreams, ensuring scope, milestones, plans and outcomes are clearly defined and actively progressed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Enterprise Data Programme Director to translate programme strategy into clear delivery plans, priorities, governance actions and execution activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate cross-functional delivery across data, technology, business, governance, analytics and AI enablement teams, ensuring dependencies and decisions are managed effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive progress against the integrated programme plan, working with workstream leads and PMO to maintain visibility of milestones, risks, issues, dependencies and critical path activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, manage and escalate risks, issues and delivery blockers, ensuring clear owners, mitigation plans and timely resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare and contribute to programme governance forums, including SteerCo and senior stakeholder meetings, with clear updates, decisions required and recommended actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Finance, PMO and delivery leads to support budget tracking, resource planning, benefits management and delivery trade-off discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage relationships with vendors, delivery partners and internal teams, ensuring commitments are understood, tracked and delivered against agreed expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support change, adoption and business readiness activity by working with stakeholders to understand impacts, dependencies and transition needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote consistent use of delivery standards, tools and governance practices, including the Transformation Delivery Framework, Wrike and agreed programme artefacts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programme or project management qualification desirable, such as MSP, PRINCE2, APM, PMI or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data, analytics, cloud or enterprise technology delivery awareness desirable, including familiarity with data platforms, data governance, integration, reporting or AI enablement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using planning, reporting and collaboration tools such as Wrike, PowerPoint, Excel, Power BI, SharePoint or equivalent platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programme management experience supporting or leading large-scale technology, data or enterprise transformation programmes in a global or multi-entity organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage complex delivery plans across multiple workstreams, stakeholders, vendors and geographies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of programme delivery disciplines, including planning, RAID, dependency management, governance, assurance, benefits tracking, financial awareness and resource coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work as a trusted delivery partner to a Programme Director, providing clear updates, escalation points and recommendations to support decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management skills, with the confidence to influence, challenge constructively and drive accountability across senior and cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to turn complex delivery information into clear, concise and action-oriented updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of data transformation environments, ideally including exposure to data platforms, governance, master data, analytics, integration or AI-related initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organised, proactive and resilient, able to create structure in ambiguity and maintain momentum across competing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and delivery-focused, with the ability to build trusted relationships and support a positive programme culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
