&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/databricks/strategic-core-account-executive-fsi-paris-320462","tags":["Enterprise Sales"],"job_types":[],"location":"Paris","created_at":1792000540},{"slug":"solutions-engineer-edi-e-invoicing-austria-germany-spain-uk-italy-hungary-portugal-croatia-388124","company_name":"ecosio","title":"Solutions Engineer - EDI/e-invoicing (f/m/d)","description":"&lt;div&gt;
