&lt;p&gt;collaborating with account executives to address technical questions in tenders&lt;br&gt;acting as a sparring partner for addressing technical questions about our solutions raised by the Sales team&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;working together with our product team on the realisation of new ERP connectors for ecosio&lt;/p&gt;
