ccounting and financial software for small businesses and their accountants</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">💰 Raise a total of €400 millions, including from Sequoia, the famous fund from the Silicon Valley who invested early in companies like Google, Facebook, Airbnb, Stripe, Paypal and much more...</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 Grow from 7 cofounders to 1000 happy Pennylaners : we’re now recognized as one of the greatest places to work in France (and also remotely), with a 4.6/5 rating on <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.glassdoor.fr/Avis/Pennylane-France-Avis-E4171708.htm">Glassdoor</a>.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">🌍 Build an international environment with more than 25 nationalities, with a strong remote-friendly culture, where 30% of the employees are already working from all parts of Europe</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">🤝 Earn the trust of thousands of customers and accounting firms and obtain <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.google.com/search?q=pennylane&amp;ei=O9pOYvm0Co-blwSmhKmIAw&amp;ved=0ahUKEwi5vsWL-4H3AhWPzYUKHSZCCjEQ4dUDCA4&amp;uact=5&amp;oq=pennylane&amp;gs_lcp=Cgdnd3Mtd2l6EAMyDQgAEIAEELEDEIMBEAoyCwguEIAEEMcBEK8BMgcIABCABBAKMgcIABCABBAKMgUIABCABDIFCAAQgAQyBQgAEIAEMgcIABCABBAKMgcIABCABBAKMgcIABCABBAKOgcIABBHELADOgkIABCwAxAKEEM6CgguEMcBEK8BEAo6BggAEBYQHjoICAAQFhAKEB46DQguEIAEEMcBEK8BEApKBAhBGABKBAhGGABQ7QFY6wVgugdoAXABeACAAUiIAbMCkgEBNZgBAKABAcgBCcABAQ&amp;sclient=gws-wiz">outstanding ratings</a></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">🚀 Already more than 900,000 small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) and over 6000 accounting firms use Pennylane in France!</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>Your mission</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will join our Growth Team and work collaboratively with <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/thomas-moessner/?originalSubdomain=fr">Thomas</a> the growth engineer team lead within the Marketign website squad.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are looking for a talented full stack software engineer whose main mission will be to ⏬</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Global Scaling:</strong> Build and refine the infrastructure supporting our internationalization (multi-language, localized user journeys…).</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Intelligent Automation:</strong> Design and deploy AI-driven tools and automated workflows to streamline lead acquisition and personalize user experiences at scale.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Tracking &amp; Insights:</strong> Implement and enhance sophisticated visitor tracking systems to turn raw data into actionable growth levers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Ecosystem Connectivity:</strong> Design and develop robust APIs to ensure seamless data flow between our internal tools and the broader fintech ecosystem.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>High-Velocity Experimentation:</strong> Launch needle-moving projects including A/B tests, white-label integrations, predictive lead scoring, and optimized acquisition funnels.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Performance Optimization:</strong> Maintain and push the limits of our public website and registration funnels for peak conversion across all markets.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>Who are we looking for ?</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">To thrive at Pennylane in this position, you need to :</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Experience:</strong> At least <strong>2+ years</strong> of professional experience as a Software Engineer.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Tech Stack:</strong> Mastery of Ruby on Rails. Proficiency in a JS Framework (Vue/Nuxt) i