&lt;li&gt;Permanent position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech stack: Google Cloud Platform, Kubernetes, Terraform, Dagster, BigQuery, dbt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-time&lt;/li&gt;
