onal requirements.</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW17873096 BCX8">This role requires a hands-on professional with a proactive mindset, a structured approach to software testing, strong attention to detail, and the ability to understand complex technical systems and translate requirements into effective test strategies.</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW57822337 BCX8" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4><strong>Key Responsibilities</strong></h4><ul><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW59353603 BCX8">Perform functional, integration, regression, system, and end-to-end testing across edge devices, cloud services, APIs, databases, and graphical user interfaces.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW59353603 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW59353603 BCX8">Define test strategies, test plans, test cases, acceptance criteria, and automated test scripts for an edge and cloud software platforms.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW59353603 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW59353603 BCX8">Identify, document, and track software defects, ensuring clear reproduction steps and proper follow-up.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW59353603 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW59353603 BCX8">Collaborate with product owners, developers and engineers to understand system requirements and ensure test coverage.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW59353603 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW59353603 BCX8">Contribute to the development and maintenance of automated test frameworks and pipelines.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW59353603 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW59353603 BCX8">Test edge–cloud behaviour under interrupted connectivity, delayed or duplicated messages, device restarts, software updates, and synchronization failures.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW59353603 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW59353603 BCX8">Validate software performance, reliability, and stability under different operating conditions.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW59353603 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW59353603 BCX8">Support testing of software running on edge hardware, including hardware–software integration in laboratory and field environments.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW59353603 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW59353603 BCX8">Analyse test results and provide clear, actionable feedback to development teams.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW59353603 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW59353603 BCX8">Ensure traceability between requirements, test cases, and test results.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW59353603 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW59353603 BCX8">Integrate automated tests into GitLab CI/CD pipelines and help define appropriate quality gates.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW59353603 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW59353603 BCX8">Contribute to continuous improvement of testing processes, tools, and quality standards.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW59353603 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW59353603 BCX8">Participate in release readiness reviews and ensure software meets quality benchmarks before deployment.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><ul><li><p>Join one of Europe’s most promising deep-tech scale-ups.</p></li><li><p>Shape the future of a rapidly growing multidisciplinary R&amp;D organization.</p></li><li><p>Competitive salary and benefits package.</p></li><li><p>Enjoy regular team activities and company events.</p></li><li><p>Fresh team lunches provided 3 times/week.</p></li></ul> <br> <h4>Requirements:</h4><p class="Paragraph SCXW119444320 BCX8">Technical skills</p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW171025757 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW119444320 BCX8">Familiarity with test management and bug tracking tools (e.g., Jira, TestRail).</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW119444320 BCX8">Programming or scripting skills (e.g., Python, C++, Javascript or similar).</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW119444320 BCX8">Experience developing automated tests using tools such as Pytest, Playwright, Cypress, Selenium, or comparable frameworks.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW119444320 BCX8">Experience testing web-based graphical user interfaces.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW119444320 BCX8">Experience testing REST APIs, back-end services, or distributed software components.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW119444320 BCX8">Experience with Docker, AWS, Gitlab , Linux and CI/CD pipelines.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW119444320 BCX8">Ability to design structured, maintainable, and reproducible automated tests.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW119444320 BCX8">Familiarity with behaviour-driven development and Gherkin specifications.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4>Qualifications:</h4><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW76713326 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW126308195 BCX8">A degree in computer science, software engineering, embedded systems, or a related technical discipline or equivalent practical experience.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW126308195 BCX8">Proven experience in software testing or quality assurance.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW126308195 BCX8">Strong understanding of software testing methodologies and lifecycle.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW126308195 BCX8">Experience with both exploratory/manual testing and automated testing.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW126308195 BCX8">Experience testing integrated systems rather than only isolated software components.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW126308195 BCX8">Proactive in identifying risks and gaps in requirements and investigating failures across multiple system components.</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW126308195 BCX8">Pragmatic and hands-on when working with hardware, software, test environments, and imperfect real-world data.&nbsp;</p></li><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW126308195 BCX8">Able to work independently while collabora