ving a HubSpot workflow or digging into performance data yourself.</p><p class="xmsonormal">You are commercially driven and focused on meaningful outcomes: engaged accounts, qualified opportunities and measurable pipeline.</p><p class="xmsonormal">You are analytical, curious and comfortable experimenting, learning from data and continuously improving your approach. And because our technology is complex, you can quickly understand technical concepts and translate them into clear and credible stories for different audiences.</p><h4><strong>What do you bring?</strong></h4><ul><li><p>Strong hands-on experience in B2B growth marketing, demand generation or a similar senior marketing role.</p></li><li><p>Experience working with complex, multi-stakeholder B2B buying cycles.</p></li><li><p>Proven experience with account-based marketing (ABM) and close collaboration with Sales.</p></li><li><p>Strong experience owning and executing end-to-end marketing campaigns.</p></li><li><p>Hands-on experience with HubSpot, including campaigns, lead scoring, workflows, nurture, reporting and attribution.</p></li><li><p>Experience across content marketing, LinkedIn, website conversion, SEO and email marketing.</p></li><li><p>A strong track record of connecting marketing activities to account engagement, qualified pipeline and commercial outcomes.</p></li><li><p>Strong stakeholder management skills and confidence working across commercial and technical teams.</p></li></ul><h4><strong>Nice to have</strong></h4><ul><li><p>Experience marketing complex technical products or solutions.</p></li><li><p>Experience within underwater security, maritime, defense, critical infrastructure, offshore energy or adjacent industries.</p></li><li><p>Experience working with government, naval, security, procurement or other complex stakeholder environments.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="xmsonormal"><strong>Interested?</strong></p><p class="xmsonormal">We would love to hear from experi