ul><li><p>Onbepaaldetijds contract Fulltime/Parttime (32/40 uur)</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>27 vakantiedagen.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Kansen voor verdere ontwikkeling en leren met een uitstekend trainings- en persoonlijk ontwikkelingsbudget van 3600 euro per jaar, waar jezelf eigenaar van bent.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Studiedagen.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Een mobilteitsregeling waarin je de keuze hebt uit een leaseauto of OV jaarkaart met een riante mobiliteits vergoeding.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Thuiswerk faciliteiten.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Vrijheid om je werkdag in te vullen.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Een pensioenregeling en overige wettelijke regelingen.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Aanvullende werknemersverzekeringen.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Een open cultuur die kennisdeling en ervaring aanmoedigt.</p></li></ul><ul><li><p>Aantrekkelijke carrièreperspectieven, zowel nationaal als internationaal.</p></li></ul><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/adesso-netherlands/data-management-consultant-utrecht-228183","tags":["Data & Analytics"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Utrecht, Utrecht, Netherlands","created_at":1792009953},{"slug":"data-engineer-utrecht-175174","company_name":"adesso Netherlands","title":"Data Engineer","description":"<p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Bouw dataplatformen die klaar zijn voor wat er morgen met data en AI gebeurt.</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">Bij adesso zoeken we een Data Engineer die verder kijkt dan alleen het bouwen van pipelines. Iemand die nadenkt over hoe data wordt verzameld, gemodelleerd, ontsloten en gebruikt en die graag werkt aan moderne data-oplossingen binnen Microsoft Azure en Snowflake.</p><p class="MsoNormal">Je werkt aan dataplatformen die organisaties daadwerkelijk gebruiken. Als basis voor reporting en analytics, maar steeds vaker ook voor machine learning, AI en agentic toepassingen.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Jouw rol</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">Als Data Engineer ontwerp en bouw je schaalbare data-oplossingen voor onze klanten. Je werkt aan het hele traject: van databron en architectuur tot een betrouwbaar platform waarop data daadwerkelijk gebruikt kan worden.</p><p class="MsoNormal">Daarbij werk je voornamelijk binnen het Azure-ecosysteem en denk je mee over keuzes rondom architectuur, datamodellering, performance en schaalbaarheid.</p><p class="MsoNormal">Je bent niet alleen degene die bouwt. Je begrijpt waarom bepaalde keuzes worden gemaakt, kunt hierover sparren met klanten en collega's en neemt verantwoordelijkheid voor de kwaliteit van de oplossing.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Wat ga je doen?</strong></p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ontwerpen, bouwen en onderhouden van schaalbare data pipelines en dataplatformen;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ontwikkelen van cloud-native data-oplossingen;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Integreren, transformeren en ontsluiten van data uit verschillende bronnen;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ontwerpen en implementeren van moderne Data Warehouse- en Lakehouse-architecturen;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Toepassen van datamodelleringsmethodieken zoals Kimball en Data Vault;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Bouwen van betrouwbare datasets voor analytics, dashboards, machine learning en AI-toepassingen;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Werken met technologieën zoals Microsoft Fabric, Azure<strong> </strong>Databricks, Azure Data Factory en Snowflake;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Optimaliseren van performance, schaalbaarheid, betrouwbaarheid en datakwaliteit;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Inrichten en verbeteren van CI/CD-processen en toepassen van DataOps-principes;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Meedenken met klanten over data-architectuur, integraties en technische keuzes;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Samenwerken met Data Scientists, AI Engineers, Data Architects en andere specialisten binnen ons Data &amp; AI-team.</p><h4></h4> <br> <p class="MsoNormal">We zoeken niet iemand die ieder vinkje op een technologielijst kan zetten. We zoeken vooral een Data Engineer die een stevig technisch fundament heeft, nieuwsgierig blijft en verantwoordelijkheid neemt voor wat hij of zij bouwt.</p><p class="MsoNormal">Je hebt:</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Minimaal 4 jaar relevante ervaring als Data Engineer of in een vergelijkbare rol;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Sterke kennis van SQL en Python;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ervaring met het ontwerpen en bouwen van ETL/ELT-processen en data pipelines;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ervaring met Microsoft Azure en relevante Azure-datadiensten, zoals Databricks, Fabric, Snowflake;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ervaring met datamodellering en moderne data-architecturen, bijvoorbeeld Kimball en Data Vault;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Kennis van Data Warehouse- en/of Lakehouse-concepten;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ervaring met CI/CD, DevOps en bij voorkeur Infrastructure as Code;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Oog voor datakwaliteit, performance, schaalbaarheid en onderhoudbaarheid;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Het vermogen om technische keuzes uit te leggen en hierover met klanten en collega's te sparren;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Een uitstekende beheersing van de Nederlandse taal.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Mooi meegenomen</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">Heb je daarnaast ervaring met een aantal van onderstaande technologieën of onderwerpen? Mooi. Maar we verwachten niet dat je alles al hebt gedaan.</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Microsoft Fabric;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Azure Databricks;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Azure Data Factory;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Snowflake;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Apache Spark / PySpark;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Delta Lake;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Power BI;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Collibra of andere data governance-oplossingen;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Azure OpenAI, Azure AI Foundry of andere AI-services binnen Azure;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Infrastructure as Code, bijvoorbeeld Terraform of Bicep.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Data &amp; AI bij adesso</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">Data is bij ons geen losstaand onderdeel van een project. Het is steeds vaker de basis waarop nieuwe digitale oplossingen worden gebouwd.</p><p class="MsoNormal">Binnen ons Data &amp; AI-team werken Data Engineers, Data Scientists, AI Engineers en andere specialisten samen aan oplossingen die verder gaan dan alleen dashboards of losse modellen.</p><p class="MsoNormal">Van moderne dataplatformen en machine learning tot generative AI en agentic AI: we willen technologie niet alleen interessant vinden, maar vooral werkend krijgen bij onze klanten.</p><p class="MsoNormal">Dat betekent dat je bij ons de ruimte krijgt om nieuwe technologie te ontdekken, maar ook wordt uitgedaagd om deze naar productie te brengen.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Waarom adesso?</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">Je komt terecht in een groeiend Data &amp; AI-team waarin veel ruimte is om mee te bouwen. Aan projecten, maar ook aan onze technische richting, kennis en manier van werken.</p><p class="MsoNormal">Je krijgt bij ons:</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Veel vrijheid en verantwoordelijkheid in je projecten;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; De mogelijkheid om mee te bouwen aan onze Data &amp; AI-propositie;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Collega's met wie je inhoudelijk kunt sparren over data, cloud en AI;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ruimte om nieuwe technologie te onderzoeken én daadwerkelijk toe te passen;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Een internationale organisatie achter je, gecombineerd met een relatief klein en persoonlijk team in Nederland;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Een opleidingsbudget van €3.600 per jaar;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Hybride werken;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Een mobiliteitsregeling;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Een goede pensioenregeling;</p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">·&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 27 vakantiedagen + 4 studie-dagen.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>En nu?</strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">Misschien voldoe je niet aan ieder technisch punt hierboven. Dat hoeft ook niet.</p><p class="MsoNormal">Als jij sterk bent in data engineering, ervaring hebt binnen Azure en enthousiast wordt van het bouwen van moderne dataplatformen, dan maken we graag kennis.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/adesso-netherlands/data-engineer-utrecht-175174","tags":["Data & Analytics"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Utrecht, Utrecht, Netherlands","created_at":1792009953},{"slug":"power-platform-consultant-bouw-slimme-ai-oplossingen-met-copilot-studio-utrecht-257567","company_name":"adesso Netherlands","title":"Power Platform Consultant – bouw slimme AI-oplossingen met Copilot Studio","description":"<p>Ben jij thuis in het Microsoft Power Platform én wil je AI niet uitleggen, maar <strong>toepassen</strong>?<br>Bij adesso bouw je met <strong>Copilot Studio, AI Builder en Power Platform</strong> oplossingen die direct waarde leveren. Geen experimenten om het experiment, maar slimme apps die gebruikt worden.</p><p>Jij zit precies waar het interessant wordt: <strong>tussen business en technologie</strong>. En je zorgt dat AI daar ook echt werkt.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>De rol</strong></p><p>Als Power Platform Consultant ontwerp en bouw je low-code oplossingen met <strong>Power Apps, Power Automate, Dataverse en Copilot Studio</strong>. Je helpt klanten om AI praktisch in te zetten: van procesautomatisering tot intelligente interactie met eindgebruikers.</p><p>Je werkt in multidisciplinaire teams en hebt directe invloed op het succes van innovatieve projecten — inhoudelijk én technisch.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Wat je doet</strong></p><ul><li><p>Je vertaalt businessvragen naar <strong>concrete AI-gedreven oplossingen</strong></p></li><li><p>Je bouwt applicaties met <strong>Power Apps, Power Automate en Copilot Studio</strong></p></li><li><p>Je zet <strong>AI Builder en Power Virtual Agents</strong> in voor automatisering en interactie</p></li><li><p>Je integreert met <strong>Dynamics 365, Azure en externe databronnen</strong></p></li><li><p>Je begeleidt klanten bij adoptie en gebruik</p></li><li><p>Je spart met collega’s over nieuwe toepassingen van <strong>generatieve AI</strong></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <p><strong>Wat jij meebrengt</strong></p><ul><li><p>Aantoonbare ervaring met <strong>Power Apps, Power Automate, Dataverse en Copilot Studio</strong></p></li><li><p>Kennis van <strong>AI Builder</strong> en ervaring met modelontwikkeling en integratie</p></li><li><p>Ervaring met <strong>Power Virtual Agents</strong> en conversational AI</p></li><li><p>Vaardig in <strong>Power Fx en/of JavaScript</strong></p></li><li><p>Bekend met <strong>Azure en Dynamics 365</strong></p></li><li><p>Sterk analytisch vermogen in complexe omgevingen</p></li><li><p>Je kunt AI-concepten helder uitleggen — ook aan niet-techneuten</p></li><li><p>Ervaring met projectmatig en klantgericht werken</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p><strong>Jouw manier van werken</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Proactief</strong> – je ziet kansen en pakt ze</p></li><li><p><strong>Nieuwsgierig</strong> – je blijft vooroplopen in AI en low-code</p></li><li><p><strong>Nauwkeurig</strong> – kwaliteit staat voorop</p></li><li><p><strong>Klantgericht</strong> – je begrijpt de vraag achter de vraag</p></li><li><p><strong>Flexibel</strong> – je schakelt makkelijk tussen teams en projecten</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Over adesso Nederland</strong></p><p>Je werkt in een <strong>betrokken, senior team</strong> met korte lijnen en duidelijke afspraken.<br>Geen bureaucratie. Wel eigenaarschap, kwaliteit en ruimte om te groeien — technisch én persoonlijk.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Wat je van ons krijgt</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Vast contract</strong> (32–40 uur)</p></li><li><p><strong>27 vakantiedagen + 4 studiedagen</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>€3.600 persoonlijk opleidingsbudget per jaar</strong> (jij bepaalt)</p></li><li><p>Mobiliteitsregeling: <strong>leaseauto of OV-abonnement + vergoeding</strong></p></li><li><p>Thuiswerken en flexibele werktijden</p></li><li><p>Goede pensioenregeling en aanvullende verzekeringen</p></li><li><p>Open cultuur met veel kennisdeling</p></li><li><p><strong>Carrièremogelijkheden in NL én internationaal</strong> (11.000+ collega’s in Europa)</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Onze cultuur</strong></p><p>Onze Culture Code is geen poster aan de muur, maar hoe we werken:</p><ul><li><p><strong>WE ARE ONEadesso</strong> – samenwerken zonder ruis</p></li><li><p><strong>WE ARE HANDS-ON</strong> – pragmatisch en oplossingsgericht</p></li><li><p><strong>WE ARE STRAIGHTFORWARD</strong> – helder en transparant</p></li><li><p><strong>WE ARE OPEN-MINDED</strong> – ruimte voor verschillen en nieuwe ideeën</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/adesso-netherlands/power-platform-consultant-bouw-slimme-ai-oplossingen-met-copilot-studio-utrecht-257567","tags":["microsoft"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Utrecht, Utrecht, Netherlands","created_at":1792009953},{"slug":"senior-angular-developer-utrecht-400703","company_name":"adesso Netherlands","title":"Senior Angular Developer","description":"<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong>Front-end is geen sausje.<br>Het ís het product.<br></strong></p><p class="isSelectedEnd">Bij Bluefront bouw je Angular-applicaties die ertoe doen. Geen demo’s voor de bühne, maar enterprise-applicaties die in productie staan. Gebruikt worden. Schaalbaar zijn. En blijven werken.<br><br>Je werkt aan complexe webapplicaties en portals waar performance, UX, security en onderhoudbaarheid net zo belangrijk zijn als hoe het eruitziet.<br><br>Je schrijft code die klopt.<br>En je weet waarom.<br><br><strong>Wat je doet.</strong></p><ul><li><p class="isSelectedEnd">Je bouwt front-ends met Angular en TypeScript in enterprise-omgevingen.</p></li><li><p class="isSelectedEnd">Je werkt met moderne component-architecturen, design systems en API-gedreven backends.</p></li><li><p class="isSelectedEnd">Je denkt mee over architectuur, UX, performance, security en technische keuzes.</p></li><li><p class="isSelectedEnd">Je fixt bugs, voorkomt nieuwe en laat code beter achter dan je ’m aantrof.</p></li><li><p class="isSelectedEnd">Je neemt verantwoordelijkheid voor kwaliteit: in je eigen werk, in reviews en in de keuzes die je samen met het team maakt.</p></li><li><p class="isSelectedEnd">Je deelt kennis met collega’s: in code reviews, sessies, meet-ups of gewoon aan het bureau naast je.<br></p></li></ul><p>Geen eilandjes.<br>Wel samenwerking.</p> <br> <p><strong>Waar je terechtkomt</strong></p><p class="isSelectedEnd">Je komt terecht bij Bluefront, het front-end team binnen adesso Nederland.<br><br>Binnen adesso bouwen we maatwerksoftware voor organisaties die meer nodig hebben dan standaardoplossingen. Bluefront richt zich op moderne webapplicaties en portals waarin UX, performance en technische kwaliteit samenkomen.<br><br>Je werkt hybride en vooral daar waar je het meeste waarde toevoegt. Vaak is dat één dag per week bij de klant, één dag op kantoor en de rest vanuit huis. Op kantoor zijn we vooral samen voor overleg, kennisdeling en verbinding.<br><br>Onze waarden zijn geen poster aan de muur:<br><strong>geloofwaardigheid, integriteit, transparantie en betrouwbaarheid.<br><br>Wat je meebrengt</strong></p><ul><li><p class="isSelectedEnd">Je bent een senior Angular developer met minimaal 7 jaar ervaring met Angular en TypeScript in een enterprise-omgeving;</p></li><li><p class="isSelectedEnd">HTML en CSS zijn voor jou geen bijzaak, maar onderdeel van goed front-end vakwerk;</p></li><li><p class="isSelectedEnd">Je hebt ervaring met complexe applicaties waar schaalbaarheid, onderhoudbaarheid en performance belangrijk zijn;</p></li><li><p class="isSelectedEnd">Je kunt uitleggen waarom je iets bouwt — niet alleen hoe;</p></li><li><p class="isSelectedEnd">Je staat open voor het gebruik van AI-tooling zoals GitHub Copilot en/of Claude. Heb je er al professioneel of privé mee geëxperimenteerd, dan is dat mooi meegenomen. </p></li></ul><p><br><em>Je spreekt Nederlands. Dat is een vereiste voor deze rol.</em></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Wat je krijgt</strong></p><ul><li><p class="isSelectedEnd">Een vast contract voor 32 of 40 uur;</p></li><li><p class="isSelectedEnd">Een salaris tussen €4.500 en €5.500 bruto per maand op basis van 40 uur;</p></li><li><p class="isSelectedEnd">27 vakantiedagen;</p></li><li><p class="isSelectedEnd">€3.600 persoonlijk ontwikkelbudget per jaar — jij bepaalt;</p></li><li><p class="isSelectedEnd">Studiedagen;</p></li><li><p class="isSelectedEnd">Leaseauto óf OV-jaarkaart + mobiliteitsvergoeding;</p></li><li><p class="isSelectedEnd">Hybride werken + thuiswerkfaciliteiten;</p></li><li><p class="isSelectedEnd">Vrijheid in hoe je je werkdag inricht;</p></li><li><p class="isSelectedEnd">Goede pensioenregeling en aanvullende verzekeringen;</p></li><li><p class="isSelectedEnd">Een open cultuur waar kennisdelen de norm is;</p></li><li><p>Carrièremogelijkheden in Nederland én internationaal.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Wil je bouwen aan front-ends die ertoe doen?<br>Dan moeten we praten.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/adesso-netherlands/senior-angular-developer-utrecht-400703","tags":["DXP"],"job_types":["Experienced","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Utrecht, Utrecht, Netherlands","created_at":1792009953}],"links":{"first":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/api/job-board-api?page=1","last":null,"prev":null,"next":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/api/job-board-api?page=2"},"meta":{"current_page":1,"current_page_url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/api/job-board-api?page=1","from":1,"path":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/api/job-board-api","per_page":300,"to":300,"terms":"This is a free public API for jobs, please do not abuse. I would appreciate linking back to the site. By using the API, you agree to the terms of service present on Arbeitnow.com","info":"Jobs are updated every hour and order by the `created_at` timestamp. Use `?page=` to paginate. Read more information here: https://www.arbeitnow.com/blog/job-board-api"}}

{"data":[{"slug":"senior-value-engineer-insurance-munich-31485","company_name":"celonis","title":"Senior Value Engineer - Insurance","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Value Engineering is responsible for our largest Fortune 500 customers and owns their transformation journey by working on the very frontier of what’s possible with data and AI on the Celons Platform. Partnering closely with the Sales team, Value Engineering is responsible for ensuring that the Celonis Platform is deployed to tackle the most strategic business challenges, fits into the right place in our customers’ technology stack and most importantly generates strong ROI through deep and broad deployments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt; As a Senior Value Engineer, you will spearhead AI and data-driven business transformation within the Insurance sector by contributing to your customer’s end-to-end value journey using the Celonis Context Model. Working alongside Lead and Principal VEs, you will combine technical execution with consulting and project management. As an AI-fluent operator, your core mandate is to orchestrate complex roadmaps and execute targeted transformation initiatives that improve how these businesses operate across their Operations &amp;amp; Claims Management ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value Selling &amp;amp; Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Uncover the real issues by peeling back layers of organizational complexity. Own the Outcome from first discovery through realized ROI for your process areas. Tell the Value Story by crafting powerful executive narratives and leading business value workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Cultivate powerful executive sponsorship across core business units to champion transformation programs. Co-own change management with customer leaders and design CoE roadmaps that build self-sufficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Steer Global Transformations across complex workstreams. Own and implement AI-driven account planning and AI-assisted project management. Automate executive governance (QBRs, SteerCos) with minimal manual friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform &amp;amp; AI Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as an AI-fluent operator, utilizing AI tools for rapid technical outputs while partnering with Applied Value Engineers for deep-dive solution builds. Champion platform adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale Value &amp;amp; Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Build a strategic expansion roadmap embedding Celonis as a strategic platform to drive adoption. Provide feedback to R&amp;amp;D based on evolving customer use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of experience taking ownership of complex workstreams, process areas, and customer relationships in Value Engineering, Consulting, or Pre-Sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Technical &amp;amp; Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid background in enterprise IT and business software (e.g., SAP, Workday, Salesforce, Oracle). You operate primarily as an AI-fluent operator, utilizing AI copilots to generate outputs and automations, avoiding heavy manual coding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builder Mentality:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable setting your own direction within an account team. Driven to &lt;em&gt;live for customer value&lt;/em&gt;, proactively hunting and ideating for highest-impact solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process Improvement &amp;amp; Value Realization:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven expertise in executing process improvements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Program &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated expertise orchestrating multi-region or business unit transformation programs. Expert at mobilizing VP/Director-level sponsorship. Flawless English [and native-level local language] communication with commanding executive presence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Industry:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of the Insurance and wider Financial Services market dynamics. You stay continuously updated on business-critical use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Degree:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineering, Computer Science, Mathematics, Business Analytics,&amp;nbsp; comparable technical degree or a Business/Economics degree paired with a technical minor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/celonis/senior-value-engineer-insurance-munich-31485","tags":["Value Engineering"],"job_types":[],"location":"Munich","created_at":1791989749},{"slug":"senior-data-scientist-workforce-management-analytics-berlin-235961","company_name":"wolt","title":"Senior Data Scientist, Workforce Management Analytics","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Support Group&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the name Support Group implies, this group is responsible for the core part of the customer experience journey that has got Wolt top-notch ratings in app stores.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;During the years we’ve invested a lot in the in-house built support tooling as we believe that it’s the only way we can ensure the satisfaction of all of our customers and partners in each of the 25 countries that we operate in. We take huge pride in our customer operations’ quality, so on top of building delightful support experiences in our consumer app we also want to proactively identify and solve issues even before our customers and partners even notice something might be wrong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Support Analytics Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Support Analytics team’s main goal is to deliver an amazing Customer, Merchants &amp;amp; Courier support experience while optimizing our operations by providing actionable insights and quantifying the impact of those actions on the overall business. 💡&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be part of this team working with top Data Science and Analytics Engineering professionals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Data Scientist at Wolt, your role involves diving into our data to solve crucial business problems. The scope of this role ranges from diagnosing problem areas to identifying solutions to designing experiments and ultimately influencing decision-making. This is a rare, operational, and actionable data-driven experience. When you join this team, you will be driving action from the frontlines, rather than just doing yet another analytics role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your job will mainly focus on driving operational efficiency with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Workforce Management (WFM) &lt;/strong&gt;team and optimizing resource allocation by creating accurate scheduling and intraday forecasts, simplifying forecasting processes, building and supporting KPI dashboards, conducting root cause analysis for SLA improvements, exploring cost optimization opportunities, managing the capacity plan framework, enhancing the WFM data pipeline, and uncovering data-driven insights to refine planning, scheduling, reporting, and intraday management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our humble expectations&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; in a data science or analytics position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building&lt;strong&gt; forecasting models and time series analysis&lt;/strong&gt; (Prophet, SARIMA, Holt-Winters or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in&lt;strong&gt; Cost Analysis and What-if Scenario Analysis&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of statistical packages in &lt;strong&gt;Python or R&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in writing structured and efficient&lt;strong&gt; SQL queries&lt;/strong&gt; for large data sets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to&lt;strong&gt; influence and advise senior stakeholders &lt;/strong&gt;Good to have:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using ML for forecasting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with ML engineers/ML platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building data pipelines using Airflow or similar tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The online delivery platform that Wolt is building will offer you interesting and complex challenges, together with the opportunities to create a big impact with your skills. Lots of geolocational and temporal data in real-time, combined with differences in the economics and dynamics of the cities we operate in, make Wolt both a challenging and interesting company to practice analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the chance to decide the ways of working: a hybrid, at the office, or remote in &lt;strong&gt;Berlin. &lt;/strong&gt;💙&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You would get to work in a company culture where we take ownership beyond the obvious, do common things uncommonly well, we think big but stay humble, do right by people, we treat others kindly and justly, recognize that if we don’t learn, we won’t stay still but fall behind and keep in mind that Luke was Yoda’s greatest achievement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Next steps&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The position will be filled as soon as we find the right person, so make sure to apply as soon as you realize you really, really want to join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For any further questions about the position, you can turn to Senior Talent Acquisition Partner - Zhanna Filintseva via &lt;a ----------
