<li><strong>Data fluency:</strong> strong Sheets/Excel, comfortable owning a funnel end to end; SQL basics a plus.</li>
<li><strong>German (C1+) and English fluent.</strong> Our contracts are German, our company language is English.</li>
<li><strong>First-principles thinker who writes things down.</strong> Default output: a document, not a meeting.</li>
<li><strong>Low ego, high bar:</strong> able to tell a founder no, with evidence.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>The process</strong></p>
<p>Exactly the one you will later run: culture screen, skill assessment with a live case (bring your AI workflows), founder final. </p>
