<li><strong>Driving the migration</strong> of customer, contract and metering processes from HubSpot into Odoo</li>
<li><strong>Building and maintaining integrations</strong> with our internal platform and external partners in logistics, metering and market communication</li>
<li><strong>Shipping features</strong> to production independently</li>
<li><strong>Setting technical standards</strong> for code reviews, automated tests, CI and code quality</li>
<li><strong>Reviewing code and pairing</strong> with our developers and our external Odoo partner</li>
<li><strong>Working closely with Finance and Ops</strong> to turn their needs into clear scope and reliable estimates</li>
</ul>
<h2>Dein Profil</h2>
