.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support team in the diagnosis of source data issues, reconciliation inconsistencies, and establishment of a single source of truth.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support data migration, ELT pipelines, and data platform consolidation.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Optimize Snowflake performance, data freshness, and data quality.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own and continuously improve the processes that keep our data platform reliable.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Use Python for data checks, automation, and utilities.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with BI and business teams to deliver certified datasets, self-service standards, and end-to-end reporting solutions.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Translate business needs into scalable data products and governed metrics.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Turn business priorities into project plans, identify risks and trade-offs, unblock the team, and drive delivery to completion.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Mentor the team on analytics engineering best practices, modern tooling, and AI-assisted development.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h3><strong>What you'll bring</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">3+ years of experience in Analytics Engineering, BI Development, Data Engineering, or a related field, including 1+ years of people or team leadership.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Expert-level SQL and strong data modeling and architecture skills, including star schemas, semantic layers, governed metrics, data contracts, and ELT pipelines.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hands-on experience building production-grade dbt projects, including staging-to-marts layering, tests, documentation, ownership, and version-control workflows.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Snowflake experience, including query performance optimization, data freshness, and quality monitoring.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Python skills for data checks, automation, and utilities.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with data quality and operations, including testing, monitoring, source-data reconciliation, CI/CD, data cataloging, and cost/performance tuning.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience creating dbt models and documentation, AI-ready data products, and using AI-assisted development tools.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience delivering certified datasets, self-service standards, and BI/reporting solutions end-to-end.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong stakeholder management and communication skills, with a hands-on, entrepreneurial, and problem-solving mindset.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A motivational leadership style, positive drive for change, and confidence to challenge assumptions and make decisions.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Nice to have </strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with semantic layer tools such as dbt MetricFlow or Snowflake Semantic Views.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with AWS, Azure, or GCP.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience leading distributed or international teams.</p></li></ul><ul style="m