&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YDvwdru2xoXfjwxNo04l9W8Sgqd&quot;&gt;The Senior Growth Manager will own local growth strategy and end-to-end program delivery across product go-to-market, customer growth, and priority segments, including advanced traders and VIPs.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YDvwdru2xoXfjwxNo04l9W8Sgqd&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K375dHlX2oiNzMxWvzGlRRLjgjc&quot;&gt;This is a hands-on senior individual contributor role responsible for translating business and product priorities into coordinated growth initiatives and measurable commercial outcomes. The role will act as the key local stakeholder for global Performance Marketing and Lifecycle teams while working closely with Product, Relationship Management, Data, Marketing, and other regional and global stakeholders.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K375dHlX2oiNzMxWvzGlRRLjgjc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
