&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-PiRwdXFmiomeQDxx0RUuDGJ1sag&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own local growth initiatives end to end, from strategy and planning through execution, optimisation, and performance reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead go-to-market programs for priority products, defining target segments, customer journeys, messaging, incentives, channel plans, and success metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop full-funnel growth strategies for advanced traders, VIPs, high-value customers, and other priority segments, driving funding, trading activity, product adoption, retention, revenue, and lifetime value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design loyalty, reward, engagement, and reactivation programs that support sustainable customer and commercial growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the key local stakeholder for global Performance Marketing and Lifecycle teams, translating local priorities into campaign briefs and collaborating on audiences, customer journeys, creative and messaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and execute customer events, VIP experiences, partner activations, and industry engagements, managing delivery from objectives and budgets through to stakeholder coordination and post-event reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Data, Relationship Management, Marketing, Legal, Compliance, Risk, and Finance to deliver coordinated, compliant, and commercially sustainable growth programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor customer and commercial performance, identify growth opportunities, and communicate insights, results, and recommendations to local, regional, and global stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
