ffers an expanded suite of creative production services, including Artistic Direction, VFX, and Motion Design, serving luxury, fashion, beauty, and lifestyle brands globally.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><u><span style="color:#424242">Role Overview</span></u></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">We are looking for a Director of Business Development to join our Corporate vertical in France. This is a pure new business hunter role — your mission is to identify, prospect, and close net new accounts across TransPerfect's full portfolio of services.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">You will be selling into mid-to-large corporate accounts across a broad range of industries, with a particular focus on sectors where TransPerfect's expanded capabilities — including creative production via The Mill — create strong differentiation and cross-sell opportunity.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">This role is ideal for a commercially driven professional who combines structured B2B sales discipline with genuine curiosity about creative, digital, and linguistic services.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><u><span style="color:#424242">What You Will Sell</span></u></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">You will represent TransPerfect's full Corporate service portfolio, including:</span></p><ul><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Translation &amp; Localisation** — documents, marketing, legal, technical, and digital content</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Interpretation** — simultaneous, consecutive, remote (RSI)</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Technology &amp; AI Solutions** — GlobalLink TMS, MT/MTPE, AI-powered workflows</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Digital &amp; Multimedia** — subtitling, dubbing, voice-over, e-learning localisation</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Creative Production (The Mill)** — Artistic Direction, VFX, Motion Design for luxury, fashion, beauty, and lifestyle brands</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Globalisation Consulting** — content strategy, workflow optimisation, language asset management</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><u><span style="color:#424242">Key Responsibilities</span></u></p><ul><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Build and manage a pipeline of net new business across the French and European corporate market</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Identify and engage key decision-makers — CMOs, Heads of Communication, Procurement Directors, Creative Directors, and Heads of Production</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Develop tailored pitches and proposals that draw on the full breadth of TransPerfect's service offering, including creative capabilities</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Lead the full sales cycle from prospecting to close, including RFP/RFI responses, commercial negotiation, and contract finalisation</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Collaborate with internal teams (Solutions, Operations, The Mill creative teams) to design compelling, client-specific solutions</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Represent TransPerfect at industry events, trade shows, and networking forums</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Contribute to market intelligence — identify trends, competitor movements, and emerging client needs</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Report pipeline, forecast, and activity accurately</span></p></li></ul> <br> <p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Experience</span></p><ul><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Minimum 3–7 years of B2B sales experience, with a strong track record in new business development</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Experience selling , multi-service solutions to corporate clients — ideally in one or more of the following: creative services, digital production, marketing services, SaaS/tech, or professional services</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Proven ability to close six-figure deals and manage multi-stakeholder, long-cycle sales processes</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Exposure to or genuine interest in creative industries (luxury, fashion, beauty, lifestyle, advertising) — a strong differentiator</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Experience navigating large organisations — identifying budget holders, managing procurement processes, and building internal champions</span></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Skills &amp; Competencies</span></p><ul><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Hunter profile— proactive, autonomous, energised by opening new doors</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Ability to sell both transactional and strategic engagements depending on client maturity</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Strong discovery and consultative selling skills— listens before pitching</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Comfortable discussing technology, AI, and workflow solutions as well as creative services</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#424242">Excellent communication and presentation skills in both French and English</span></p></li><li><p class="MsoNormal"><span